  "vibe": "Carbon black (#14161a) cut with gate cyan (#29d3e8) and hot magenta (#ff2e88). Orbitron locks every title into caps; Exo 2 carries the telemetry. The world is an FPV course seen from the goggles: three rounded race gates scale from 0.3 to 1.5 and rush past the lens in alternating cyan and magenta, a white quadcopter banks ±30° along a Lissajous path with four prop discs spinning at 900°/s, four speed streaks tear across at 1000px per second, and an Orbitron HUD counts LAP and lap time in the corner. This is an unusually hard camera — multiplier 7, 6° skew, 1.3° roll, a spin move — with slam entrances and streak titles. It owns a firmware diff, a voltage bar, a throttle slider and race-control alerts.",
